
h1 Uploads and ingestion operations API

h2 Upload sequence

h2 Bulk file uploads

h3 GET /v1/drives/{drive_id}/uploads/capabilities
{"version":1,"max_items":50,"max_body_bytes":65536}

h3 POST /v1/drives/{drive_id}/uploads/batch
{
  "files": [
    {
      "key": "library-0001-file-0001",
      "external_id": "opening-hours",
      "filename": "opening-hours.txt",
      "format": "txt",
      "size_bytes": 18,
      "sha256": "REPLACE_WITH_SHA256_OF_ORIGINAL_FILE"
    }
  ]
}

h3 POST /v1/drives/{drive_id}/uploads/batch/complete
{"files":[{"id":"UPLOAD_UUID","transport":"direct"}]}

h3 POST /v1/drives/{drive_id}/uploads/batch/status
{"ids":["UPLOAD_UUID","ANOTHER_UPLOAD_UUID"]}
Field | Meaning
id | Upload ID to save for recovery.
state | Upload state, such as awaiting_content, queued, running, accepted, or failed.
document_id | Document ID when available.
operation_id | Indexing operation ID when available.
warnings | File-processing warning codes.
error_code | Upload or extraction error, if present.
processing_status | Associated operation status: queued, running, searchable, or failed, when available.
processing_error_code | Associated operation error, if present.
index_snapshot_id | Published index snapshot ID when available.

h2 Prepare the file
printf '%s\n' 'Refunds are available within 30 days of purchase.' > handbook.txt
FILE_SIZE=$(wc -c < handbook.txt | tr -d ' ')
FILE_SHA256=$(shasum -a 256 handbook.txt | cut -d ' ' -f 1)
 
curl -X POST "$POLYGRES_BASE_URL/v1/drives/$DRIVE_ID/uploads" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer $POLYGRES_API_KEY" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -H "Idempotency-Key: handbook-prepare-1" \
  -d "{\"external_id\":\"handbook\",\"filename\":\"handbook.txt\",\"format\":\"txt\",\"size_bytes\":$FILE_SIZE,\"sha256\":\"$FILE_SHA256\"}"
curl -X POST "$POLYGRES_BASE_URL/v1/drives/$DRIVE_ID/uploads/$UPLOAD_ID/transfer" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer $POLYGRES_API_KEY" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -H "Idempotency-Key: handbook-destination-1" \
  -d '{}'

h2 Inspect an upload
curl "$POLYGRES_BASE_URL/v1/drives/$DRIVE_ID/uploads/$UPLOAD_ID" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer $POLYGRES_API_KEY"

h2 Follow the transfer instructions
Response | Next step
{"transport":"proxy"} | PUT the original file bytes to the upload’s /content endpoint. Send the workspace bearer key, Content-Type: application/octet-stream, and an idempotency key for that transfer.
{"transport":"direct","url":"…","headers":{…},"expires_in":600} | PUT the original bytes to the returned signed URL with the returned headers and the file’s exact Content-Length. The signed URL authorizes this transfer; keep the workspace bearer key for API requests. The actual expiry is supplied by the response.
curl -X PUT "$POLYGRES_BASE_URL/v1/drives/$DRIVE_ID/uploads/$UPLOAD_ID/content" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer $POLYGRES_API_KEY" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/octet-stream" \
  -H "Idempotency-Key: handbook-transfer-1" \
  --data-binary @handbook.txt
 
curl -X POST "$POLYGRES_BASE_URL/v1/drives/$DRIVE_ID/uploads/$UPLOAD_ID/complete" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer $POLYGRES_API_KEY" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -H "Idempotency-Key: handbook-complete-1" \
  -d '{}'

h2 Wait for searchable content
curl "$POLYGRES_BASE_URL/v1/workspaces/$WORKSPACE_ID/operations/$OPERATION_ID" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer $POLYGRES_API_KEY"

h2 POST /v1/drives/{drive_id}/uploads
Name | Location | Value | Required
drive_id | path | string | Yes
Idempotency-Key | header | string | Yes
Field | Type | Presence | Guidance
external_id | string | Required | Your stable document identifier within this drive; at most 1,024 UTF-8 bytes.
filename | string | Required | 1 to 255 UTF-8 bytes; longer names return 400 invalid_text. Path separators (/, \), line breaks, and other control characters return 400 invalid_filename.
format | pdf, docx, txt, md | Required | Original file format; must match the file bytes.
size_bytes | integer | Required | Minimum: 1. Maximum: 1000000000
sha256 | string | Required | SHA-256 of original bytes as 64 lowercase hexadecimal characters.
folder_id | string or null | Optional | uuid
metadata | object | Optional | Flat labels, at most 64 fields and 8,000 encoded bytes. Replacement does not merge old labels.
Field | Type | Present | Constraints
id | string | Yes | uuid
state | string | Yes | 
expires_in | integer | Yes | Always 86400: the upload session lasts 24 hours. Send and complete the file before then. After it expires, transfer and completion requests return 409 upload_expired or 409 upload_sealed; create a new upload. Completing an upload whose file was never sent returns 409 upload_incomplete.

h2 GET /v1/drives/{drive_id}/uploads/{upload_id}
Name | Location | Value | Required
drive_id | path | string | Yes
upload_id | path | string | Yes
Field | Type | Present | Constraints
id | string | Yes | uuid
state | string | Yes | 
document_id | string or null | Yes | uuid
operation_id | string or null | Yes | uuid
warnings | array of object | Yes | Each has a code string; PDF page warnings also have a page number, from 1.
error_code | string or null | Yes | 
error_message | string or null | Yes | 

h2 PUT /v1/drives/{drive_id}/uploads/{upload_id}/content
Name | Location | Value | Required
drive_id | path | string | Yes
upload_id | path | string | Yes
Idempotency-Key | header | string | Yes
Field | Type | Present | Constraints
id | string | Yes | uuid
state | string | Yes | 
uploaded | true | Yes | 

h2 POST /v1/drives/{drive_id}/uploads/{upload_id}/transfer
Name | Location | Value | Required
drive_id | path | string | Yes
upload_id | path | string | Yes
Idempotency-Key | header | string | Yes

h2 POST /v1/drives/{drive_id}/uploads/{upload_id}/complete
Name | Location | Value | Required
drive_id | path | string | Yes
upload_id | path | string | Yes
Idempotency-Key | header | string | Yes
Field | Type | Presence | Guidance
transport | direct | Optional | Send direct after a direct transfer; omit after a proxy transfer.
Field | Type | Present | Constraints
id | string | Yes | uuid
state | string | Yes | 

h2 GET /v1/workspaces/{workspace_id}/operations/{operation_id}
Name | Location | Value | Required
workspace_id | path | string | Yes
operation_id | path | string | Yes
Field | Type | Present | Constraints
id | string | Yes | uuid
status | queued, running, searchable, failed | Yes | 
index_snapshot_id | string or null | Yes | uuid
error_code | string or null | Yes | 
error_message | string or null | Yes | 
created_at | string | Yes | 
completed_at | string or null | Yes | 
document_count | integer | Yes | 
usage | object | Yes | 

h2 Bulk imports
Limit | Value
Source bytes per import | 100,000,000,000
Documents per import | 1,000,000 (the drive limit)
Chunks per import | 100,000
Bytes per chunk | 32,000,000
Documents per chunk | 10,000
Chunks declared per request | 32
Chunks declared but not yet acknowledged | 32, and at most 1,000,000,000 bytes
Formats | txt and md, UTF-8

h3 Chunk format
{"schema":"wondersearch-import-chunk.v1","mode":"create","documents":[
 {"external_id":"guides/setup.md","filename":"setup.md","format":"md","metadata":{},
  "expected_revision":null,"offset":0,"size_bytes":1834,"sha256":"<hex>"}]}

h3 PUT /v1/drives/{drive_id}/imports/{import_id}

h3 POST /v1/drives/{drive_id}/imports/{import_id}/chunks

h3 POST /v1/drives/{drive_id}/imports/{import_id}/chunks/{sequence}/acknowledge

h3 POST /v1/drives/{drive_id}/imports/{import_id}/seal

h3 GET /v1/drives/{drive_id}/imports/{import_id}

h3 Other actions

h2 Progressive import progress
Field | Meaning
accepted_documents | Number of documents accepted in this request.
indexed_documents | Documents whose associated work has become searchable.
failed_documents | Documents associated with failed processing work.

h2 Upload timings and drive queues

h3 Upload completion timings
Field | Meaning
created_at | Upload session creation timestamp.
uploaded_at | File verified and saved for processing.
searchable_at | Associated operation completed publication.
transfer_ms | Time from creating the upload to saving the file for processing.
queue_ms | Time the file spent waiting to be processed.
processing_ms | Time spent processing the file until it was searchable.
uploaded_to_searchable_ms | Time from saving the file to the document becoming searchable.
total_ms | Session creation to publication completion.

h3 GET /v1/drives/{drive_id}/ingestion-metrics
curl "$POLYGRES_BASE_URL/v1/drives/$DRIVE_ID/ingestion-metrics" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer $POLYGRES_API_KEY"
Field | Meaning
scope | drive.
drive_id | Selected drive ID.
active_transfers | Unfinished, unexpired sessions.
transfer_limit | 50.
outstanding_limit | 10,000 across active transfers and files waiting to be read or being read.
processing | A summary of the drive’s processing work.